# Sparse 3D construction and reversible iterations.
RESET
BOX 0 0 0 15 15 0
SPHERE 40 40 40 7
SET 999999999 999999999 999999999 1
ASSERT 999999999 999999999 999999999 1
STATS
VERIFY 20
SAVE cube_plain.b3d
ENCODE 100
SAVE cube_encoded.b3d
DECODE
ASSERT 999999999 999999999 999999999 1
STATS
SAVE cube_roundtrip.b3d
